# Software License Agreement

This Agreement ("Agreement") is entered into on December 15^th^, 2024, between ACME Corporation and the Licensee.

## Definitions

**"Software"** means the computer program licensed under this Agreement, including version 2.1.0^beta^ and all related documentation.

**"License"** means the permission granted herein to use the Software under the terms specified in @section-2.

**"Intellectual Property"** includes all copyrights, patents, trademarks, and trade secrets related to the Software.

## Grant of License

SUBJECT TO the terms and conditions of this Agreement, Licensor hereby grants to Licensee a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the Software.

### Scope of License

The license includes the right to:

1. Install the Software on up to five (5) computers
2. Use the Software for internal business purposes only
3. Create backup copies as specified in @section-4
4. Access technical support as outlined in @section-6

> "This license is fundamental to the operation of your business systems," as stated in our Technical Manual^v2.1^.

## Technical Specifications

### System Requirements

The Software requires the following minimum specifications:

- Operating System: Windows 10^x64^ or Linux Ubuntu 18.04<sup>LTS</sup>
- Memory: 8GB RAM minimum, 16GB recommended
- Storage: 2GB available space
- Network: TCP/IP connectivity on port 443^SSL^

### Chemical Formula Support

For scientific applications, the Software supports chemical notation including:

- Water: H~2~O
- Carbon Dioxide: CO~2~
- Sulfuric Acid: H~2~SO~4~
- Complex molecules: C~6~H~12~O~6~ (glucose)

::section-break

## Performance Metrics

As detailed in our benchmarking study^2024^, the Software achieves:

| Metric        | Value          | Reference            |
| ------------- | -------------- | -------------------- |
| Response Time | <100ms         | @table-1             |
| Throughput    | 10,000 ops/sec | Technical Report^Q4^ |
| Uptime        | 99.9%^SLA^     | Service Agreement    |
| Memory Usage  | <512MB         | @section-3           |

See @figure-1 in the appendix for detailed performance graphs.

## Legal Obligations

WHEREAS, the parties wish to establish a legal framework for software usage;

THEREFORE, the following obligations apply:

1. **Compliance**: Licensee must comply with all applicable laws and regulations
2. **Intellectual Property**: Respect for ACME's intellectual property rights as defined in Article 15^USC^
3. **Data Protection**: Adherence to GDPR^EU^ and CCPA<sup>CA</sup> requirements
4. **Audit Rights**: ACME may audit usage as specified in @section-7

PROVIDED THAT these obligations do not conflict with local laws in the Licensee's jurisdiction.

## Warranty and Disclaimers

The Software is provided "AS IS" without warranty of any kind. ACME disclaims all warranties, whether express^written^ or implied<sup>legal</sup>, including but not limited to:

- Merchantability warranties under UCC^Article-2^
- Fitness for particular purpose
- Non-infringement of third-party rights
- Compatibility with future operating systems^next-gen^

> **Important Notice**: This disclaimer is subject to applicable consumer protection laws^local^.

## Termination

This Agreement may be terminated:

1. By either party with thirty (30) days written notice
2. Immediately for material breach as defined in @section-8
3. Upon bankruptcy or insolvency of either party
4. When superseded by a new agreement version^updated^

